        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: బాధపడు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బాధపడు — bādhapaḍu — \"to feel sad; to grieve\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "స్నేహితుడు వెళ్ళిపోయాక నేను చాలా బాధపడ్డాను. snēhituḍu veḷḷipōyāka nēnu cālā bādhapaḍḍānu. After my friend left, I was very sad."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): బాధపడ్డాను, bādhapaḍḍānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The cause takes -కి: ఆ మాటకి బాధపడ్డాను, that remark upset me."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బాధపడు (bādhapaḍu) joins బాధ, \"pain, sorrow\", a loan from Sanskrit bādhā, to the native verb paḍu, \"to feel, to suffer\" (DEDR 3853)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
