              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బాధపెట్టు — bādhapeṭṭu — \"to hurt; to upset\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నా మాటలు ఆమెను బాధపెట్టాయి. nā māṭalu āmenu bādhapeṭṭāyi. My words hurt her."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): బాధపెట్టాను, bādhapeṭṭānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "For feelings rather than the body: మనసును బాధపెట్టు (bādhapeṭṭu), to hurt someone deeply."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బాధపెట్టు (bādhapeṭṭu) joins బాధ, \"pain\", a loan from Sanskrit bādhā, to the native verb peṭṭu, \"to put\": to cause someone pain."
