            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "కుంగిపోవు — kuṅgipōvu — \"to be crushed; to sink in spirit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఉద్యోగం పోయాక అతను కుంగిపోయాడు. udyōgaṁ pōyāka atanu kuṅgipōyāḍu. After losing his job, he was crushed."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): కుంగిపోయాను, kuṅgipōyānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally to sink and go: a -పోవు compound, like వెళ్ళిపోవు."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "కుంగిపోవు (kuṅgipōvu) is a native compound: DEDR 1767 lists Telugu k(r)uṅgu, \"to sink, to fall down\", with Kannada kuggu; pōvu, \"to go\" (DEDR 4572) completes it. Someone who sinks in spirit is crushed."
            }
          ]
        },
